cat > diagnosis.json <<'EOF'
{"spec_element": "invariant", "proof_obligation": "preservation", "diagnosis": "The outer loop invariant at line 9 (rows 0..m-1 already copied from old src) could not be proved after the inner loop. The inner loop's effective modifies clause allows it to modify dst, and its invariants say nothing about rows before m, so Dafny loses the fact that earlier rows are still copied. The inner loop needs an invariant preserving the already-copied rows."}
EOF
